      "pronunciationText": "An app like this just runs the same rule we've been using, very fast. To see what each input does, change one thing at a time, and keep the rest fixed. That way, any change in the answer comes from that one input. And in an exam, you still show the formula. The tool is for exploring and checking. Right now, the twenty thousand, two hundred and ninety-eight dollars is eighteen thousand dollars of deposits, plus two thousand, two hundred and ninety-eight dollars and five cents of interest."
